      "updated_at": "2018-07-19T18:30:00Z",
      "body": "There could be two parts to this:\r\n1. If your NMM is below version 0.65.2 you won't be able to access the Nexus servers due to a GDPR-related update.\r\n2. You cannot use your email address as a username when logging in to NMM, you need to use your Nexus username.\r\n\r\nGrab [NMM 0.65.9](https://github.com/Nexus-Mods/Nexus-Mod-Manager/releases/tag/0.65.9), and you should have no issues logging in.",
